        "tab_2_text": "<p>Growing kids need consistent nutrition from balanced meals. Smart Gummies includes selected vitamins, minerals and amino acids to complement that routine.</p><p><strong>Vitamin D</strong> — supports normal bones and development.</p><p><strong>Zinc</strong> — supports normal growth.</p>",
