        "tab_3_text": "<p>School, playtime and everyday activities mean growing kids need consistent immune support too.</p><p><strong>Vitamin C</strong> — supports normal immune function.</p><p><strong>Vitamin D</strong> — supports normal immune function and development.</p><p><strong>Zinc</strong> — supports normal immune function.</p>",
